  unitName: Pistol God Heidt
  unitId: 50094
  unitNumber: 330
  description: A pistoleer from another world active on the outskirts of the ruined
    La Veda Republic. As the war grew in intensity, Heidt disappeared for a period
    of time. He eventually returned, brandishing a massive gun, and with a confident
    devil-may-care smile on his face he said, "Ha ha ha. I was scolded for not having
    properly finished what I came here to do!" It's said that no one since has been
    able to match his superior shooting skills.
  summonDesc: Guns can be used for different reasons.<br>Some are good and some are
    bad.<br>How do you plan to use mine?
  fusionDesc: Hey now!<br>Is that all you've got?<br>Let's give it a little more!
  evoDesc: Evolution is easy, you know. <br>All it takes is a kind word from a girl<br>to
    motivate a man to improve himself.
  element: 5
  rarity: 4
